<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-05-19T22:04:36.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-intro-hyperlinks-ba894eda-996e-4366-a4b3-24f5a7dadb2f",
        "text": "The internet is all about connecting! Hyperlinks are like digital bridges that let users jump from one webpage to another.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/0023363dfee0e98925432b081c2f9bb3-test-lesson-intro-hyperlinks-panel-1-f688ed01-0dc0-48e2-891e-6321b5414953.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-intro-hyperlinks-8d1c4a5f-f345-4b6f-97fe-b455748b17f0",
        "text": "In HTML, we create these amazing connections using the `<a>` tag. The 'a' stands for 'anchor' – it anchors your link!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/32c48466373d3d84cc0a1873ede5964b-test-lesson-intro-hyperlinks-panel-2-6b23a8b9-e2d8-4dd8-bcad-0aa0315e5632.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-intro-hyperlinks-0af4d92f-7821-4d6a-9173-9f38c5b26b97",
        "text": "But how does the link know *where* to go? That's where the `href` attribute comes in! It holds the destination address.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/83bfada1c628942211fafa336b03a22e-test-lesson-intro-hyperlinks-panel-3-66c2c1a5-058f-4596-a86a-58ad3c2ecc7d.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-intro-hyperlinks-3bf314cd-241b-47a2-8fda-85b7de134535",
        "text": "Want to send visitors to another website entirely? Just put that site's full web address, like `https://www.example.com`, into your `href`!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/84ce42b47bc63f98c4cb276fc1c3d345-test-lesson-intro-hyperlinks-panel-4-39268342-3871-4180-8b8f-433c676187c4.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-intro-hyperlinks-c2264039-b56b-4d2e-85a7-bb5ffe7c1867",
        "text": "You can also create links to other pages *within your own project*, or even to specific sections *on the same page*!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/19c6e2bb9057d00315b61b67ac0788b8-test-lesson-intro-hyperlinks-panel-5-0ec32e69-50eb-4591-8a86-4dda2eadc1a0.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "Introduce hyperlinks (<a> tag) as the way to connect different web pages or sections within the same page. Explain the 'href' attribute and how it specifies the destination of the link. Discuss the difference between external links (to other websites) and internal links."
  },
  "published": true,
